# Local SmolRTSP checkout & firmware build workspace (see README prerequisites)
# NOTE: smolrtsp must live at src/smolrtsp (sibling of src/ak_rtsp), not the repo root --
# the Makefile's "../smolrtsp" include paths are relative to src/ak_rtsp/.
